      "message": "fix(app): Thread declares no rim; merge main (verify ctx carries the rims)\n\nReview item on #1073: since #1071 the thread region reads the major\ncircle, so the Thread arm of rims_of declared a minor circle that traced\nno loop and its pin failed. Thread leaves rims_of and keeps the\ntightened reading (conservative); the pin now holds that a coarse model\nnever reads a thread mill looser than full fidelity. Merge of main:\nmain's VerifyContext refactor taken, `rims: &rims` added beside\nmodel_excess; the test thread mill gains main's `catalog` field.\n\nRefs #1057\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
